// ETW Logging/Processing Option Disabled On IIS Server | T1505.004, T1685.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/iis-configuration/win_iis_logging_etw_disabled.yml
(event.code:29 AND winlog.event_data.Configuration:*@logTargetW3C AND winlog.event_data.OldValue:*ETW*) AND (NOT winlog.event_data.NewValue:*ETW*)
